Package: resonance
Version: 0.5.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Maintainer: sudo-megas <sudo-megas@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/sudo-megas/RESONANCE
Description: Dotfile syncing that is for "users" not developers
 RESONANCE mirrors your dotfiles between $HOME and a vault directory:
 add an app's files once, and it tracks checksum-based drift, backs up
 changes, and restores byte-identical copies with a pre-restore undo
 snapshot. GPL-3.0-or-later.
